              "sourceContextAndLimits": "BB/BE common2022 RLP pp9/13/14 develops criteria-based decisions, ethics, ecological/economic/social perspectives, safety and reflection in both courses, with LK greater complexity. Current five-criterion packaging/information and two societal-ethanol cases are own operational material. Their complete application/transfer scope is not exact whole source credit or proof of learner research, medicine advice or a total environmental metric.",
